---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+12815550199';
---
<Layout title="Green Algae in Pool – Spring, TX Treatment" description="Green algae pool treatment in Spring, TX. Shock, brush, vacuum, and residual plan to clear and prevent return.">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><h1>Green Algae</h1><p>Clear the bloom and keep it from coming back.</p></div></section>
  <section class="content-section"><div class="container" style="max-width:800px">
    <p>Green algae thrives when chlorine residual drops and temperatures rise. Texas summers make prevention critical, but once it appears we can recover the pool efficiently.</p>
    <h2>Recovery Steps</h2>
    <ul><li>Heavy shock treatment matched to the severity</li><li>Thorough brushing of all surfaces</li><li>Vacuuming of dead algae</li><li>Filter cleaning and circulation</li><li>Stabilizer and residual plan to prevent recurrence</li></ul>
    <p>Severe cases may need more than one visit. We give a realistic timeline and cost before we begin.</p>
    <p style="margin-top:2rem"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Start Recovery</a></p>
  </div></section>
</Layout>
